{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1130926-gen-con-announcements","id":1130926,"title":"Gen Con Announcements","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-18T12:33:33-07:00","id":1130926,"title":"Gen Con Announcements","content":"Rich Thomas announced new C20 books this morning at Gen Con.<br /> <br /> First was a C20 players guide. He also said the line would go deeper into Changeling magic, deeper into the kiths, and explore kingdoms across the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T12:47:49-07:00","id":1130929,"title":"","content":"YEEEEEEEES!!!!! Are you gonna write on this player guide Charlie?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T13:40:20-07:00","id":1130949,"title":"","content":"*Tries to get his smartphone to accept some dollar bills* When can you take this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12678-monkeydjie","name":"Monkeydjie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T16:08:49-07:00","id":1130998,"title":"","content":"YASSSS!!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5821-neon-sidhe","name":"Neon.Sidhe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5821_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T20:21:36-07:00","id":1131104,"title":"","content":"...oh yeah, CtD never had a revised edition.<br /> <br /> Man it's got a LOT of catching up to do. For the &quot;deeper into the Kiths&quot; part...well, would have preferred for them to get their own book devoted to just Kiths, a &quot;Lore of the Kiths&quot; if you will, but ah well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T01:47:33-07:00","id":1131163,"title":"","content":"Here are some things from the original Kickstater page, that were Stretch Goals which backers unlocked with their contributions beyond the Changeling 20th funding:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><i><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;<u>We will add the legendary 14th House as a full House write-up to <b>Changeling 20th Anniversary Edition</b></u>.&quot;</span></i></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;<u>We will add an expanded look at the Seelie and Unseelie Courts into <b>C20 </b>itself</u>, <u>including what they meant in the pre-Sundering times when the Kithain shared the responsibility of ruling</u>, <u>and what they have come to mean now</u>. <u>Also</u>, <u>how individual changelings relate to their Seelie and Unseelie Legacies</u>, <u>and how the switch between them happens in play</u>.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;<u>We will create </u><b><u>Kithbook</u>: <u>Boggans</u></b>, <u>designed to match the previous classic Kithbooks</u>. <u>Every backer who pledged for a Reward Tier containing a physical copy of the <b>Deluxe Changeling 20th Anniversary Edition</b> will receive a copy of the PDF</u>.&quot;</span></span></i><br /> <br /> I'm hoping this will bring about an eventual (and much needed) PoD option for this Kithbook.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><i>&quot;<u>We will do our research and add the Kith from the </u><b><u>WoD</u>: <u>France</u></b><u> book</u> (<u>well</u>, <u>MdT</u>:<u> France</u>) <u>book</u>, <u>and the Kith from </u><b><u>Trolls</u>, <u>Dreamers</u>, <u>and the Deep Woods</u></b> (<u>Trolle</u>, <u>Tr\u00e4umer</u>, <u>tiefe</u> <u>W\u00e4lder</u>) <u>to <b>Changeling 20th Anniversary Edition</b></u>. <u>So</u>, <u>more text and page count and art for more Kiths</u>!&quot;</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&quot;<u>We will add a @10,000 word section to <b>Changeling 20th Anniversary Edition</b> that describes how to create your own Kith</u>.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<u>Every backer who pledged for a Reward Tier containing a physical copy of the <b>Deluxe Changeling 20th Anniversary Edition</b> will receive a copy of the</u> &quot;<u>Guide to Freeholds</u>&quot; <u>PDF</u>, <u>a new @20K word supplement to <b>C20</b></u>. <u>How to Create and Maintain your very own Freehold</u>.&quot;</span></span></i><br /> <br /> Again, my hope is that we will get a PoD option for this content.<br /> <br /> &lt;&gt;<br /> <br /> Okay, now on the original post ---<br /> <br /> A Changeling: the Dreaming 20 Player Guide would be fantastic. It helps with these sort of guides, to give help separate the information your players should have, from the ST knowledge.<br /> <br /> On going deeper into Changeling Magic. I'm encouraged by this, because it makes me feel as though the unreleased Book of Glamour may finally see the light of day. A rough draft of this book was made some 15 or 16 years ago. One of the this books authors,<b> Krister M. Michl, </b><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">made prior remarks on some of the content, whereas</span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&quot;a section on Dark Glamour (how to gain it, what happens if you enjoy it too much, etc.) and a full chapter on a new [old] magic that came back to the Autumn Realm with the Second Resurgence.&quot; <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Let's keep our fingers crossed, we get this in a print form.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">I believe giving more depth to Kiths is a great idea. Though, by looking at the Unlocked Stretch Goals, many of them regard Kith. And so, although refreshing to see anything about C20 &amp; expanding the gameline forward, More Kith isn't something we weren't expecting.</span> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">I am glad they gave us a glimpse of what we can expect the focus to be on. And I can't wait to be holding these books in my wanting hands, flipping through the pages with Dreamy Eyes &amp; nimble fingers.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:20:22-07:00","id":1131197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1130926-gen-con-announcements?p=1130929#post1130929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">YEEEEEEEES!!!!! Are you gonna write on this player guide Charlie?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what I'll be working on. Freeholds is the last book I'm contracted for currently.<br /> <br /> As for some of the other questions, my impression was that magic, kiths, and kingdoms were other books in addition to the players guide.<br /> <br /> I doubt going deeper into changeling magic means a straight up release of Book of Glamour's unpublished text. I haven't read much from BoG, but my impression from talking to folks who worked on it is that C20 went in a fairly different direction.<br /> <br /> KB: Boggans will definitely be available as print on demand after it's released.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:37:00-07:00","id":1131209,"title":"","content":"The impression I got at the panel was that the Changeling 20th players guide was a singular text that would include the deeper inspection of the magic system, kiths, and look at some kingdoms around the world. <br /> <br /> Though I could be mistaken, that was just the impression I got from Rich Thomas. I would love a series of texts to explore each of those , like a Kingdoms book or a book on the Gallain.<br /> We will excitedly get to seeee","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12563-inathicon","name":"iNathicon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T06:07:14-07:00","id":1131225,"title":"","content":"Hahahaha, you know as much as I do! It could be wishful thinking on my part. I'm sure we'll find out for certain soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T09:56:36-07:00","id":1131325,"title":"","content":"So release in 2020?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T17:37:30-07:00","id":1131527,"title":"","content":"Awesome! Can't wait!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T08:02:24-07:00","id":1132609,"title":"","content":"This is very exciting. I'm looking forward to seeing more information on the C20 Players Guide. I hope we get more kiths included. If I get tapped for that project, I know my first thought would be to give an official write-up to the drakes, although I've also got a couple other kith ideas kicking around in my head. I also can't wait to see the kingdoms across the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T02:37:18-07:00","id":1134408,"title":"","content":"Jesus! C20 Players GUIDE!!!! I loved the old Players Guide which gave us the Nunnehi and Pyretics! That's a very cool precedence for C20 considering how much I loved the C20 core! Oh man I am hyped! I want them to give this a good word count! I'm super Psyched! C20 and W20 are my most hyped gamelines for the Classic Universe!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}